1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,742
The minus sign means eight point zero nine kilojoules of work is done on the gas.

2
00:00:05,742 --> 00:00:13,255
No heat can leave, so all of that work stays inside as internal energy, and the temperature soars.

3
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:16,132
That is why diesel fuel ignites with no spark.

